   "x": -162,
   "y": 499,
   "width": 274.34,
   "height": 96.25,
   "text": "EXPOSES:\n- commit / register / renew  (payable)\n  (passes the plaintext label to registrar)\n- rentPrice / available / valid\n- registerReserved / addReservedNames\n- admin: setPriceOracle/freeze,\n  setMinCharLength, disableNftGate",
   "fontSize": 11,
