   "text": "STORES (key -> value):\n- ownerOf[tokenId]; balanceOf[owner]\n- expiries[tokenId] -> uint; grace period\n- labelOf[tokenId] -> 2LD label (write-once)\n- _ownedTokens[owner][i]; _allTokens[i]\n  (ERC721Enumerable indices)\n- controllers[addr] -> bool; baseNode\n- metadataRenderer (address, settable)",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "STORES (key -> value):\n- ownerOf[tokenId]; balanceOf[owner]\n- expiries[tokenId] -> uint; grace period\n- labelOf[tokenId] -> 2LD label (write-once)\n- _ownedTokens[owner][i]; _allTokens[i]\n  (ERC721Enumerable indices)\n- controllers[addr] -> bool; baseNode\n- metadataRenderer (address, settable)",
