   "x": 516,
   "y": 1171,
   "width": 312.62,
   "height": 137.5,
   "text": "EXPOSES:\n- register(LABEL, owner, duration) onlyController\n  (API takes the plaintext label -> labelOf)\n- renew, ownerOf / transferFrom, nameExpires\n- balanceOf / tokenOfOwnerByIndex / totalSupply\n  (ERC721Enumerable -> trustless My Names)\n- labelOf(tokenId); name() / symbol()\n- tokenURI(tokenId) -> delegates to renderer\n  (NFT title = the domain name)\n- setMetadataRenderer (onlyOwner)",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "EXPOSES:\n- register(LABEL, owner, duration) onlyController\n  (API takes the plaintext label -> labelOf)\n- renew, ownerOf / transferFrom, nameExpires\n- balanceOf / tokenOfOwnerByIndex / totalSupply\n  (ERC721Enumerable -> trustless My Names)\n- labelOf(tokenId); name() / symbol()\n- tokenURI(tokenId) -> delegates to renderer\n  (NFT title = the domain name)\n- setMetadataRenderer (onlyOwner)",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
